# Playwright browsers are provisioned by the environment, not the repo
node_modules/

# Nothing beginning with _ belongs in the deploy output. quote-site/ is served
# verbatim by Vercel, so a scratch file dropped in here during a design review
# becomes a public URL on the client's domain. This caught a full copy of
# another client's landing page staged as quote-site/_ref.html — which would
# have published their branding and phone numbers at collisionglass.co/_ref.html.
quote-site/_*
